Effects in forge-frames-fx.bundle come from Unity Asset Store packs and are shipped only inside this built bundle; the packs' own files are not
redistributed. Pack, licence as recorded by the effect library, effects used:

Forge own effects
  Forge's own effect, generated by ForgeVfxOwnEffects.cs
  frame_charge_dust, frame_heat, frame_kick, frame_landing, frame_pulse, frame_siege, frame_vent, frame_wreck_smoke

Free Quick Effects Vol 1
  Standard Unity Asset Store EULA (may ship inside built mod bundles; raw assets must not be redistributed or committed)
  frame_kick, frame_landing, frame_pulse, frame_siege

Master MagicFX Bundle 1.0
  Unity Asset Store EULA（只能随构建发布，不能分发原素材）
  蓝色冰晶碎裂冲击, 蓝色星光命中爆点

PRO Effects Sci-fi Shooter FX  Unity6 v1.2
  Unity Asset Store EULA（只能随构建发布，不能分发原素材）
  灰白钢铁火花飞溅

Particle Pack Starter Assets
  Standard Unity Asset Store EULA (may ship inside built mod bundles; raw assets must not be redistributed or committed)
  橙黄地面火焰

Super Magic FX - 1700 Unique VFX 1.8
  Unity Asset Store EULA（只能随构建发布，不能分发原素材）
  红色暗黑冲击

Triple-A Sci-fi effects 2.1
  Unity Asset Store EULA（只能随构建发布，不能分发原素材）
  橙色火焰爆炸

War FX
  Standard Unity Asset Store EULA (may ship inside built mod bundles; raw assets must not be redistributed or committed)
